  "description": "Specification-compliant ISO 15765-2 (ISO-TP) implementation for CanKit.Pro: deterministic Single-/First-/Consecutive-/Flow-Control-frame codec, bounds-checked PCI parser and STmin helpers, plus an actor-driven runtime (IIsoTpChannel) that composes on top of the CanKit.Pro L2 services (RawCan demux, TX-confirm, Actor, Reliability deadlines) — no vendor-SDK dependency.",
